  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Create YAML",
      "items": [
        "Standard mapping builds a plan, then renders SQL + YAML; AI handles ambiguous mappings.",
        "JOIN, Excel Report Pack, Custom SQL, and Silver / Coalesce have variant paths."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Run validation",
      "items": [
        "Prerequisite gate: a YAML for the table must already exist under Project/config/<layer>/data_validation/ — this step never generates one (see ADR 0028).",
        "Scans layer / report YAMLs; select table and validation type.",
        "runner.py launches main.py; YAML generation does not execute the file."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Dependencies & boundaries",
      "items": [
        "Sources: PostgreSQL / Redshift, MSSQL, Athena; Snowflake is the target. Credentials come from env.",
        "YAML holds executed SQL; CSV stays local; SQLite stores summaries. Coalesce / JIRA are out-of-run."
      ]
    }
  ]
